OCM is multi-licensed by directory. There is no single project license.

  software/                          AGPL-3.0-only
  hardware/                          CERN-OHL-S-2.0
  spec/ modules/ cells/ docs/
  reference/ claims/                 CC-BY-SA-4.0

Each directory contains its own LICENSE file with the full text.
See LICENSING.md for the rationale, and for the dependency compatibility table.

*** Software is GPLv3-family. NEVER GPLv2. ***
Apache-2.0 (Tesseract, ROS 2, TrajOpt) is one-way compatible with GPLv3 and
INCOMPATIBLE with GPLv2. A GPLv2 choice would leave this project with no motion
planner. Do not add IgH EtherCAT Master or LinuxCNC -- both are GPLv2.
